---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo from '../assets/me.jpg';
---

<section id="about" class="bg-blush">
  <div class="wrapper flex flex-col py-20 md:py-24">
    <h2 class="mt-0 mb-6 font-grotesque text-4xl font-bold text-accent">About</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg lg:prose-xl">
      <div class="float-left -mt-1 rounded-2xl py-0 pr-6">
        <Image
          src={photo}
          alt="Armando Sosa"
          width={240}
          densities={[1, 2]}
          format="webp"
          quality={80}
          class="w-60 rounded-2xl"
        />
      </div>
      <p>
        Hello! My full name is <em>Armando Quetzalcoatl Sosa Garay</em>, but my friends just call me
        <strong> Armando</strong>. All three of them.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm a small Mexican dude who's been doing internet stuff for what feels like an eternity. I
        used to be a graphic designer, but that's the worst-paid profession in Mexico, so I pivoted
        to programming and I've been doing a lot better.
      </p>

      <p>
        When I'm not in front of a computer, you'll find me attending church, playing music, or just
        hanging out with my wonderful wife.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm a type-2 diabetic, which sucks because eating is my favorite hobby. Look, it's not my
        fault that I live in the country with the best food in the <del>world</del> universe.
      </p>

      <p>
        I've been a remote front-end engineer since 2009, for companies in New York, San Francisco,
        and Colombia. These days I'm a lead engineer at <a href="https://jiveworld.com">Jiveworld</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you want to know more, you can <a href="https://twitter.com/soska">follow me on X</a> or send
        an electronic letter to <em>arm.sosa[at]gmail.com</em>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
